      "bytes": 39384,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-15-020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "不是你问的吗。\n总之，恭喜你",
      "voiceId": "event235-15-022",
      "storyId": "467",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-015.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-015.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory467_rip/event235-15-022.mp3",
      "sha256": "f074db0eb33b413a3baea977bf6568f727f01bc09973c3a0cf6751af2d3d2e75",
      "bytes": 46260,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-15-022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "一直有人在给你发消息哦",
      "voiceId": "event235-23-003",
      "storyId": "475",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory475_rip/event235-23-003.mp3",
      "sha256": "4cf5ddf344f31b3e626f1dd5464e7910c733d31ac514d962510b72402da120e2",
      "bytes": 26892,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-23-003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "『现在在哪』『出来』『出来啊』『至少看一下吧』。\n你真是受欢迎呢",
      "voiceId": "event235-23-004",
      "storyId": "475",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory475_rip/event235-23-004.mp3",
      "sha256": "d2e97913fd24f9d9f447008cc746eea9232fa35476f440220438a7b383efb137",
      "bytes": 64224,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-23-004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "不去参加乐队练习没关系吗？",
      "voiceId": "event235-23-006",
      "storyId": "475",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory475_rip/event235-23-006.mp3",
      "sha256": "7655ef409e9d56f1bfc8816a25bce7ffa8732fb0957e81d0442c68fac367b325",
      "bytes": 22068,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-23-006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "原来如此……\n你失落的时候很安静，真不错呢",
      "voiceId": "event235-23-008",
      "storyId": "475",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory475_rip/event235-23-008.mp3",
      "sha256": "8fd232520af09ae28fce537709e4e75f7de2bcc4d5fb2fd5e91b135458ac8907",
      "bytes": 34272,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-23-008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "再见。\n我还要去乐队，先回去了",
      "voiceId": "event235-23-009",
      "storyId": "475",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory475_rip/event235-23-009.mp3",
      "sha256": "8649956880e00e5803c17b96d853e59c9dc83a85115e65100406d146421010d9",
      "bytes": 36936,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-23-009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "能为自己的乐队而烦恼，\n我其实有点羡慕",
      "voiceId": "event235-23-011",
      "storyId": "475",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-023.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory475_rip/event235-23-011.mp3",
      "sha256": "8c87831c5a1fa3d1906b81da42d03bdb91cfe37a4b991fdc1fbae6274df4a3b8",
      "bytes": 46800,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-23-011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "久等了。\n如果你们在忙的话，我就先出去？",
      "voiceId": "event235-30-013",
      "storyId": "482",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory482_rip/event235-30-013.mp3",
      "sha256": "808e19226d04e1450ab014ee533a8b4a2753fef461c01606aca24917554f478e",
      "bytes": 45216,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-30-013.mp3",
      "subtitle": "久等了。\n如果你们在忙的话，要不我待会儿再来？",
      "displayRevision": 2
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "我是八幡海铃。\n在大概30支乐队中兼职，不介意的话就好",
      "voiceId": "event235-30-016",
      "storyId": "482",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory482_rip/event235-30-016.mp3",
      "sha256": "e32576135d66fca00b4bd35ae0b121587917e0dd6b3c76a563769c7709d49c47",
      "bytes": 53424,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-30-016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "不过，实际在活动的大概有10支左右吧。\n提前一个星期联系我的话，我会尽可能参加的",
      "voiceId": "event235-30-018",
      "storyId": "482",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory482_rip/event235-30-018.mp3",
      "sha256": "cd47a8bdeb32288e5715092d02454c31b3c409d2d3bc985006e803b8f8c32fce",
      "bytes": 87984,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-30-018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "唔……\n大概情况我明白了",
      "voiceId": "event235-30-029",
      "storyId": "482",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory482_rip/event235-30-029.mp3",
      "sha256": "1ebc8d0276377182e3b4ffc71c1fa7ebd1db2fefc6071a07c900656d0ad1af1e",
      "bytes": 32328,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-30-029.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "……看来你们还没忘记前任呢",
      "voiceId": "event235-30-031",
      "storyId": "482",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory482_rip/event235-30-031.mp3",
      "sha256": "d48dcabf3f2db8735e201522cf7f1e6e49b57893974e111963ad1c71cdcc432d",
      "bytes": 25992,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-30-031.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "贝斯手的事情，\n请你们内部讨论好之后，再和我商量吧",
      "voiceId": "event235-30-033",
      "storyId": "482",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory482_rip/event235-30-033.mp3",
      "sha256": "e0a5707e08bccf1d33aef6213b5cf2c83d40f04835ae9ea6f6eb630108c4b60a",
      "bytes": 49212,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-30-033.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "那么……\n我会为你们加油的",
      "voiceId": "event235-30-035",
      "storyId": "482",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-030.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory482_rip/event235-30-035.mp3",
      "sha256": "ffd104d6cb9562210d972d2706a994a4a2d7c0b0e2932863195c5bf5e5d28362",
      "bytes": 23796,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-30-035.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "我打算提前到17点。\n三角同学，你后面有安排吧",
      "voiceId": "event235-35-002",
      "storyId": "487",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-035.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-035.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory487_rip/event235-35-002.mp3",
      "sha256": "70dd42b0301ef4a2b17ad455f13d5be9eda573bf2962e7b035aed6c6f67e2ff8",
      "bytes": 49500,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-35-002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "……？怎么了？",
      "voiceId": "event235-35-004",
      "storyId": "487",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-035.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-035.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory487_rip/event235-35-004.mp3",
      "sha256": "1a629eaa8271eaf597d49bbead2b4bd7970fcd6757ea0e8975024e971506646a",
      "bytes": 12744,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-35-004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "哦哦，原来你吃醋了吗",
      "voiceId": "event235-35-006",
      "storyId": "487",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-035.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-035.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory487_rip/event235-35-006.mp3",
      "sha256": "2e9100e582b5946c2b08f8e96c198026580a67ac5c7c4298a7a29daad16531c9",
      "bytes": 19728,
      "path": "assets/voices/bestdori_event235-35-006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "characterId": 339,
      "speaker": "海鈴",
      "speakerCn": "海铃",
      "text": "乐队的事情，好像圆满解决了呢。\n如果还需要帮忙的话，随时找我",
      "voiceId": "event235-35-008",
      "storyId": "487",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-035.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/045_rip/Scenarioband8-035.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory487_rip/event235-35-008.mp3",
      "sha256": "71b6cae7f96b152c1e2011830f45d2cedb151a72d2d236da8f828528fd4f06f9",
